WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.080
A la mierda eso.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.600
I'm confiscating this.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.040
Ma, lock it in the safe.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.200
I'll come by later

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.800
for an examination.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.240
What... what examination?

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.520
I'm sure you're the one

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.040
who shot at Gina last week.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.200
But I need more than suspicion.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.320
I want proof.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.240
Walt,

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.080
you didn't give me an answer.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.120
Dad,

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.080
becoming chairman,

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.280
that's what I wanted for a long time.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.480
But I'm out.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.640
I love Gina,

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:48.800
and I want to be with her.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.400
Forget it.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:52.520
Just forget it.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.160
That woman can never

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.960
give you what's most important -

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.360
a legacy.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.400
Enough Richard.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.560
My sacrifice is enough.

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:04.360
You ruined my life.

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:07.680
You made Henry into a monster.

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:09.640
And now you want to steal

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:11.160
Walt's happiness?

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:12.640
No.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:14.680
Leave him alone.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.640
Let him be happy.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:20.800
Why are you still here?

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:22.960
Thank you, Ma.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:25.240
Dad.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:26.800
Bro.
